Resources used while working on the project:

- C standard library documentation for `printf`
- Documentation for `<stdarg.h>`
- `man 3 printf`
- `man 3 stdarg`
- 42 project subject

### AI usage

AI was used as a learning assistant during the project.

It was used to:
- explain how `va_list`, `va_start`, `va_arg`, and `va_end` work;
- discuss the structure of the format parser;
- explain hexadecimal conversion and pointer output;
- help identify compilation and linker errors;
- help design additional tests.

The implementation itself was written and reviewed by the student.
